# casewareExportService is the confirmed one: it dropped a dormant account
# carrying R130,000 and left the export out of balance by exactly that.
# kpiChartsService carried the predicate in a LEFT JOIN ON clause, where it
# restricted nothing at all and the cash trend summed every transaction.
#
